    "inputs": {
      "prompts": "subject_definitions:\n<Girl> is the young cartoon girl in the opening frame: blonde hair tied back with a pink clip, big blue eyes and a light blush, light grey zip-up hoodie with pink graphic text, white t-shirt with a cartoon cat face, black jogger pants, blue fingerless gloves with dark dots, white chunky sneakers. Confident, mischievous smile.\n\nsummary:\nA single continuous take, no cuts. The video opens on the exact presented first frame and comes to life: <Girl> performs a playful choreographed routine in the room, then the camera settles on her final pose. She does NOT sing, does NOT speak, and has NO lip-sync - her mouth stays closed.\n\ndetailed_description:\nCinematic stylized 3D animation, soft window light, gentle warm rim light, clean grey wall and wooden floor matching the first frame. Eye-level camera, slow orbit around <Girl>.\n\n[Shot 1] 00:00.000-00:10.000. The video starts on the exact first frame - <Girl> standing centre-frame on the wooden floor - and she springs into motion: hip pops, a quick spin, a point at the camera, hair and hoodie following every move. The camera orbits her slowly and settles as she lands on a confident final pose, chin up, one fingerless-gloved hand on her hip.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet room tone, soft footfalls and sneaker squeaks on the wooden floor, faint fabric rustle; no dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nDriving synthwave electronic score: heavy bassline, arpeggiated synths, punchy four-on-the-floor beat, fast tempo. Intensity matches her performance.",
